' Tour slide 7 — "Who talks to whom, and in what order?"
' Sequence diagram over the SAME course-registration territory. Plan §S s7.
' Register for a section, with the capacity check and the two outcomes.
@startuml
!include _theme.puml
hide footbox

actor Student as S
participant "Registration" as R
participant "Section" as SEC
participant "Enrollment" as E

S -> R : register(section)
R -> SEC : seats available?
SEC --> R : count
alt seats available
  R -> E : create
  R --> S : enrolled
else section full
  R --> S : waitlisted
end
@enduml
